VibeGuard for Orca — Attribution Notice
========================================

This project is a port and continuation of ideas, detection rules, and
engineering decisions from **DeepSec** (VS Code extension + Python core;
the project was itself formerly named VibeGuard):

    https://github.com/Unclecheng-li/DeepSec
    (analysed at commit fff031f; see docs/02-deepsec-fidelity.md)

